OL,3,GNEWSANew electric car 'make or break
OL,4,Afor Jaguar'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Bailey, professor of business
OL,7,Feconomics at the University of
OL,8,FBirmingham, said it was a "perfect
OL,9,Fstorm" for the firm, which has
OL,10,Fstruggled since a cyber attack last
OL,11,Fyear.
